[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5152531450","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121700#issuecomment-5152531450","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121700","id":5152531450,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMx1j-g","user":{"login":"Grace-Shao","id":77251173,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MjUxMTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77251173?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grace-Shao","html_url":"https://github.com/Grace-Shao","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grace-Shao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grace-Shao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grace-Shao/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grace-Shao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grace-Shao/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grace-Shao/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grace-Shao/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grace-Shao/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grace-Shao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-01T17:22:58Z","updated_at":"2026-08-01T17:22:58Z","body":"@AThousandShips @Calinou Small nudge for PR review when you are free :)) TY! \r\n(Feel free to assign someone else for review too!)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5152531450/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5692253166","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121700#issuecomment-5692253166","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121700","id":5692253166,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABU0jj7g","user":{"login":"exaltedo2","id":173569997,"node_id":"U_kgDOClh3zQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173569997?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2","html_url":"https://github.com/exaltedo2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-16T04:56:08Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T08:54:11Z","body":"Apologies — I wrote tests for `FontVariation` and opened #123539 before noticing this PR was already open. That was my mistake: I checked the tracker's checklist, which still lists only the two closed attempts, and didn't search for open PRs. I'm closing mine in favour of yours.\n\nA few things I ran into while working on it, in case any of them are useful here. Please take whatever you like, or ignore all of it:\n\n- **Font size.** `InterVariable.ttf` is 859 KB as shipped. Subsetting it to ASCII with `pyftsubset --unicodes=U+0020-007E --no-hinting` and saving as WOFF2 keeps the `wght` and `opsz` axes and `gvar` intact at about 41 KB, and `FontFile::load_dynamic_font()` reads WOFF2 fine — `test_fontfile.cpp` already loads one.\n- `tests/data/font/InterVariable.tff.license` looks like it has `tff` where `ttf` was meant.\n- **Axis keys.** `{\"wght\": ...}` is silently ignored; only the integer tag and the single name `tag_to_name()` returns (`\"weight\"`) are honoured. I opened #123541 about that, since the class reference documents `wght` as a valid `String` key.\n- **Behaviour worth asserting.** Every `FontVariation` setter is guarded by an inequality check before `_invalidate_rids()`, so setting the same value twice must not emit `changed`. `set_variation_opentype()` and `set_opentype_features()` call `duplicate()`, so mutating the caller's dictionary afterwards must not reach the font. `set_base_font()` connects to the base font's `changed` signal and disconnects it on replacement.\n- **Spacing is exactly assertable.** `SPACING_GLYPH` applies to glyphs but not to spaces, so for `\"Test text\"` it adds `value * 8`; `SPACING_SPACE` adds `value * 1`; `SPACING_TOP` and `SPACING_BOTTOM` go to the line height instead of the width.\n\nMy branch is at `exaltedo2/godot@add-font-variation-tests` if you want to look at or reuse any of it.\n\n*AI disclosure*: I used Claude Code while writing those tests; everything above was verified by building and running the engine locally.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5692253166/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"low-quality"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5694183425","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121700#issuecomment-5694183425","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121700","id":5694183425,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABU2ZYAQ","user":{"login":"exaltedo2","id":173569997,"node_id":"U_kgDOClh3zQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173569997?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2","html_url":"https://github.com/exaltedo2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-16T08:07:36Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T08:54:20Z","body":"Small correction to what I wrote above — I got the *reason* for the `* 8` wrong, and I'd rather flag it than have it end up in a test comment.\n\nIt isn't that spaces are skipped. In `_shape_run()` (`text_server_adv.cpp`) the spacing is skipped for the **last** glyph of the string, and when `SPACING_SPACE` is `0` a space just picks up `SPACING_GLYPH` like any other glyph:\n\n```cpp\n// Do not add extra spacing to the last glyph of the string and zero width glyphs.\nif (sp_sp && is_whitespace(p_sd->text[glyph_info[i].cluster])) {\n    gl.advance += sp_sp;\n} else {\n    gl.advance += sp_gl;\n}\n```\n\nMeasured with `SPACING_GLYPH = 4`:\n\n| string | length | width delta |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `\"Test text\"` | 9 | 32 |\n| `\"Testtext\"` | 8 | 28 |\n| `\"abc\"` | 3 | 8 |\n\nSo it's `(length - 1) * value`, and the space in `\"Test text\"` was a coincidence — my wording would have given the wrong number for any string without one. Sorry for the noise, and good luck with the PR!\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5694183425/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"low-quality"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5694771594","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121700#issuecomment-5694771594","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121700","id":5694771594,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABU29Rig","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-16T08:54:41Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T08:54:41Z","body":"@exaltedo2 please do not use AI to write comments","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5694771594/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5734137881","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121700#issuecomment-5734137881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121700","id":5734137881,"node_id":"